<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="2fee7101">Take the business information needs and create: 
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Information request letters/emails to the appropriate individuals explaining the piece(s) of information sought
        after
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        A log of the information requests with the following fields at a minimum: date requested, description of requested
        information, individual who sent documentation &amp;&amp;nbsp;contact information, date received
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="9440bf16"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="e85f093e">There should be a disciplined approach to coordinate information requests in order to minimize client disruption.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="d23ad9bd"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="68008121">The purpose of this task is to identify the appropriate sources for the required information and issue the relevant
requests to the client.</attribute>
